      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.Checkbox"
    },
    {
      "Original": "If checked, will only show your own GC vendor",
      "Translated": "如果勾选此选项，将仅显示您自己的 GC 供应商",
      "Context": "SettingsWindow.Draw",
