      "Source": "ai:deepl",
      "PreserveID": true,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.Checkbox"
    },
    {
      "Original": "If checked, will show shop name info e.g. 'Purchase Disciple of Magic Gear - Purchase Gear (Lv. 20-29)'",
      "Translated": "如果勾选此项，将显示商店名称信息，例如“购买《魔法装备之徒》——购买装备（20-29级）”。",
      "Context": "SettingsWindow.Draw",
      "Source": "ai:deepl",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGuiComponents.HelpMarker"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Highlight selected npc",
      "Translated": "突出显示选中的NPC",
      "Context": "SettingsWindow.Draw",
      "Source": "ai:deepl",
      "PreserveID": true,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.Checkbox"
    },
    {
      "Original": "If checked, will highlight npcs that sell last item searched for once they are visible on-screen",
      "Translated": "如果勾选此选项，当屏幕上出现出售最后搜索过的物品的NPC时，系统会将其高亮显示",
      "Context": "SettingsWindow.Draw",
      "Source": "ai:deepl",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGuiComponents.HelpMarker"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Highlight Color",
      "Translated": "高亮颜色",
      "Context": "SettingsWindow.Draw",
      "Source": "ai:deepl",
      "PreserveID": true,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "包含可翻译的独立显示位置；功能或未证明的位置保持原文，写入时逐位置核对"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Highlight menu selections",
      "Translated": "突出显示菜单选项",
      "Context": "SettingsWindow.Draw",
      "Source": "ai:deepl",
      "PreserveID": true,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.Checkbox"
    },
    {
      "Original": "If checked, will highlight menu selections so items are easier to find.\n\nNOTE: If you search for another item that is sold by a vendor whose menu you already have open, this\nwill cause both the previous item and the new item to be highlighted. I could fix this, but the only way I\nknow how is to redraw every non-highlighted item with the original color. The highlighting occurs every\nframe, and I'm not willing to add another loop per frame for this use case which I think is stupid.",
      "Translated": "如果勾选此选项，将高亮显示菜单选项，以便更轻松地找到项目。\n\n注意：如果你搜索的另一个项目由某位商人出售，而你已经打开了该商人的菜单，这\n会导致先前项目和新项目都被高亮显示。 我本可以修复这个问题，但我\n唯一知道的方法是把所有未被高亮的项目都重绘为原始颜色。高亮效果每\n帧都会发生，而我并不愿意为了这种我认为很愚蠢的使用场景，每帧再增加一个循环。",
      "Context": "SettingsWindow.Draw",
      "Source": "ai:deepl",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGuiComponents.HelpMarker"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Max Search Results",
      "Translated": "最多搜索结果",
      "Context": "SettingsWindow.Draw",
      "Source": "ai:deepl",
      "PreserveID": true,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.InputInt"
    },
    {
      "Original": "The max number of search results when using the text command to prevent chat spam.\n\nMax allowable is 50.",
      "Translated": "为防止聊天垃圾信息，使用文本命令时搜索结果的最大数量。\n\n最大允许值为 50。",
      "Context": "SettingsWindow.Draw",
      "Source": "ai:deepl",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGuiComponents.HelpMarker"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Results View Type",
      "Translated": "结果查看类型",
      "Context": "SettingsWindow.Draw",
      "Source": "ai:deepl",
      "PreserveID": true,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.Combo"
    },
    {
      "Original": "How the plugin displays vendor location results.\n\nSingle will pick the first result and print it to your chat window.\n\nMultiple will display the results in a popup window. If you leave it as this the plugin will function as it did before with no changes.",
      "Translated": "该插件如何显示商家位置搜索结果。\n\n选择“单个”将选取第一个结果并显示在您的聊天窗口中。\n\n选择“多个”将把结果显示在弹出窗口中。如果您保持此设置不变，该插件将与之前一样运行，没有任何变化。",
      "Context": "SettingsWindow.Draw",
      "Source": "ai:deepl",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGuiComponents.HelpMarker"
    },
